<section class="manifesto">
  <div class="manifesto__card">
    <p class="manifesto__eyebrow">Why Fractional</p>
    <h2>
      A full-time CFO is a <em>Series C</em> hire.
      A fractional one is what gets you there.
    </h2>
    <p class="manifesto__body">
      Most Series A and B companies don't need, and can't yet afford, a full-time finance executive.
      What they need is someone who has closed rounds before, sitting in the room for the two weeks a
      quarter that actually matter, and building the model and reporting rhythm that make the other
      eleven weeks run themselves.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .manifesto__card {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 56px 64px;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-border) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 22px 22px;
  }

  .manifesto__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .manifesto__body {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 58ch;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .manifesto {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .manifesto__card {
      padding: 40px 26px;
    }
  }
</style>
